        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function template provides a generic, constexpr implementation for determining the minimum of two values of any type that supports comparison.</para>
<para>The function returns a reference to the lesser of the two input values, as determined by the <computeroutput>&lt;</computeroutput> operator. If the second argument is less than the first, it is returned; otherwise, the first argument is returned.</para>
