    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ header file with declarations for the µTest++ mathematical utilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides the declaration of the mathematical utility template used within the µTest++ framework: the absolute value, used by the approximate comparison; and, only if the deprecated functionality is enabled, the minimum value, used by the tolerance of the deprecated wrappers. The exponentiation and the compile-time parsing of the numeric literals, which serve only the deprecated wrappers and literals, are declared in <computeroutput><ref refid="deprecated_8h" kindref="compound">deprecated.h</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para>These utilities are lightweight, <computeroutput>constexpr</computeroutput>, and support both integral and floating-point types.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1math" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::detail::math</ref></computeroutput> namespace, since they are implementation details of the comparisons, not part of the public API.</para>
<para>This file is included by <computeroutput><ref refid="micro-test-plus_8h" kindref="compound">micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus.h</ref></computeroutput>, which is the header that the applications include. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
